# Trigger

{badge Automation | orange | glow} **Trigger** is an automation panel. You write rules as text, and glowing **pods** react when your documents or a watched folder of `.radii` files change!

[Open Trigger](/trigger)

## A rule

```
#!trigger-[sync]-Writeout->notify!#
```

Type rules like this into the panel and a pod appears for each one. The pods glow when the documents or files they watch change!

## Where it fits

Trigger is for small chores that you would otherwise remember by hand, like noticing when a document changes. It runs in the app, on your computer!
